{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40027","headline":"贡余秘色茶盏 · 徐夤","name":"贡余秘色茶盏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捩翠融青瑞色新，陶成先得贡吾君。\n功剜明月染春水，轻旋薄冰盛绿云。\n古镜破苔当席上，嫩荷涵露别江濆。\n中山竹叶醅初发，多病那堪中十分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}